#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:8
msgid "移植"
msgstr "Porting"

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:10
msgid "协议核心使用 C11。产品提供 PHY、单调时钟、静态存储或显式分配回调，并负责串行执行。"
msgstr ""
"The core uses C11. The product provides the PHY, monotonic clock, caller storage or explicit allocation "
"callbacks, and serializes execution."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:12
msgid "PHY 契约"
msgstr "PHY Contract"

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:19
msgid "TX 收到一帧完整数据，只有消费或复制全部字节后才能返回 `XGL_OK`。包括 DMA 在内，返回后不得保留该指针。临时背压只能表示整帧未接纳，接口不能表达半帧接纳。"
msgstr ""
"TX receives one complete frame. Return `XGL_OK` only after consuming or copying every byte. Do not "
"retain the pointer, including for DMA. Return temporary backpressure only when the frame was not "
"accepted; the interface cannot represent partial-frame acceptance."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:21
msgid "RX 的 `*len` 输入为可写容量，输出为实际字节数，绝不能超出容量。无数据时返回 `XGL_OK` 并将长度置零。调用须非阻塞或具有明确执行时间上限；回调不能重入实例。"
msgstr ""
"RX receives the available buffer capacity in `*len` and writes the actual byte count back. It must never"
" exceed capacity. With no data, return `XGL_OK` and zero length. Calls must be nonblocking or have a "
"bounded execution time; callbacks cannot reenter the instance."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:23
msgid "时间和调度"
msgstr "Time and Scheduling"

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:25
msgid "应用为发送、step 和超时查询提供 `uint32_t now_ms`。实例生命周期内统一使用同一单调毫秒时间源。支持无符号回绕；时间间隔和经过时间的比较必须小于 `2^31` 毫秒。"
msgstr ""
"The application supplies `uint32_t now_ms` to send, step, and timeout queries. Use the same monotonic "
"millisecond source for the lifetime of the instance. Unsigned wraparound is supported; intervals and "
"elapsed comparisons must stay below `2^31` milliseconds."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:27
msgid ""
"定期或在 RX/定时事件到达时调用 `xgl_step()`。`<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` 的 `xgl_deadline_query()` "
"返回下次唤醒的相对延迟。不需要注册全局时间函数，也不需要协议定时器线程。"
msgstr ""
"Call `xgl_step()` periodically or on RX and timer events. `xgl_deadline_query()` from "
"`<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` gives the relative delay to the next wakeup. The application drives timing through"
" the owner loop for each instance."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:29
msgid "存储和生命周期"
msgstr "Storage and Lifetime"

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:31
msgid ""
"优先使用对齐的调用者存储与 `xgl_init_static()`。先查询目标 ABI 的精确需求，不能将宿主机结构体大小直接复制到固件。需要由 allocator 提供存储时，使用 "
"`<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>` 的 `xgl_init_allocated()`。显式 allocator 的回调接收其 `ctx`，返回满足对齐要求的存储，并在销毁时释放工作区。"
msgstr ""
"Prefer aligned caller storage with `xgl_init_static()`. Query the exact size for the target ABI. When an"
" allocator supplies storage, use `xgl_init_allocated()` from `<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>`. The explicit allocator"
" callbacks receive their `ctx`, supply aligned storage and release the workspace at destruction."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:33
msgid "Workspace、不可变配置、PHY 描述符、provider 描述符及上下文必须保持地址固定且活到销毁。不同实例需要不同 workspace，以及独立管理的上下文。"
msgstr ""
"Workspace, immutable configuration, PHY descriptors, provider descriptors, and contexts must remain "
"valid at fixed addresses until destruction. Separate instances need separate workspaces and "
"independently managed contexts."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:35
msgid "ISR 和 RTOS 集成"
msgstr "ISR and RTOS Integration"

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:37
msgid "ISR 可以写应用自有 ring 或通知协议任务。解析、认证、ACK 处理及用户回调在串行化的任务或主循环上下文中执行。"
msgstr ""
"An ISR may fill an application-owned ring or signal the protocol task. Parsing, authentication, ACK "
"processing, and user callbacks run in the serialized task/main-loop context."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:39
msgid ""
"每个实例使用单一 owner task，或由应用锁覆盖所有 API，包括 stats 和 destroy。递归 mutex 不能让回调重入变安全。异步驱动对数据的所有权必须在 PHY TX "
"返回前由适配层处理完整。"
msgstr ""
"Use one owner task per instance, or an application lock around every API including stats and destroy. A "
"recursive mutex does not make callback reentry safe. Complete asynchronous driver ownership inside the "
"adapter before returning from PHY TX."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:41
msgid "停机与平台适配"
msgstr "Shutdown and platform adaptation"

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:43
msgid "先停止新提交，排除并发 API 调用并等待当前回调退出，再调用 `xgl_destroy()`。共享 PHY、分配器或安全 provider 的独立实例仍由应用同步这些共享对象。"
msgstr ""
"Stop new submissions, exclude concurrent API calls and wait for active callbacks before calling "
"`xgl_destroy()`. The application still synchronizes a PHY, allocator or security provider shared by "
"independent instances."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:45
msgid "在 Nexus 等平台上，将适配放在产品。适配器在 TX 返回前把整帧复制到自有槽，处理满槽及 IRQ/DMA 的借用结束；owner 驱动 XGL 与底层服务。产品决定设备、时钟域、等待与恢复。"
msgstr ""
"For a platform such as Nexus, keep the adapter in the product. Before TX returns, it copies the complete"
" frame to owned storage, handles full slots, and tracks IRQ/DMA borrows until they end. The owner drives"
" both XGL and the provider. The product selects the device, clock domain, wait and recovery policy."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:47
msgid "验证"
msgstr "Verification"

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:49
msgid "使用真实驱动验证拆分帧、突发数据、RX ring 满、PHY 背压、ACK 丢失、时钟回绕及资源耗尽。"
msgstr ""
"Exercise split frames, bursts, full RX rings, PHY backpressure, lost ACKs, clock wrap, and resource "
"exhaustion on the real driver."

#: docs/zh/guides/porting.md:51
msgid "低功耗调度见[相对期限指南](low-power.md)。"
msgstr "See the [relative-deadline guide](low-power.md) for low-power scheduling."
